<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Dashboard</title>
<style>
  .container{
    display:flex;
    align-items:flex-start;
    width:100%;
  }
  .grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:32px;
    border:1px solid;
    height:200px;
    outline:solid;

  }
  #box1{
    height:400px;
    width:800px;
    background-color: aqua;
    outline:solid;
    margin:10px;
    border-radius:10px;


  }
    #box2{
    height:450px;
    width:250px;
    background-color:pink;
    outline:solid;
    margin:10px;
    border-radius:10px;
  }

  #box3{
    height:350px;
    width:200px;
    background-color:blue;
    outline:solid;
    margin:10px;
    border-radius:10px;
  }
  
 
</style>
</head>
<body>
 <h1>Task 1:SAAS Landing Page</h1>
 <h2>Build a responsive SAAS landing page with flexbox for navigation and grid for feature selection</h2>
<div class="container">
  <div id="box1">box1</div>
  <div id="box2">box2</div>
  <div id="box3">box3</div>
</div>  
<div class="grid">
  <div id="g1">Colour Palatte</div>
  <div id="g2">Typography</div>
  <div id="g3">Key Value</div>
</div> 
    </body>
    </html>